# User Documentation - Movie Recommendation API

## Introduction

The Movie Recommendation API is a backend service that provides movie data and user authentication for a movie recommendation application. It allows users to browse trending, upcoming, top-rated, and recommended movies through various API endpoints. The system also supports user authentication via Google OAuth for personalized features.

---

## Product Overview

This application is built using Node.js with Express.js framework. It serves movie data from JSON files and manages user authentication through Passport.js. The API is documented using Swagger for easy integration and testing.

---

## Key Components

### 1. Authentication System
The authentication system allows users to log in using their Google accounts. It uses Passport.js with Google OAuth 2.0 strategy. When a user clicks the Google login button, they are redirected to Google for authentication. Upon successful authentication, they are redirected back to the application with a session.

### 2. Movie Data Routes
The application provides multiple endpoints to access different categories of movie data. Each endpoint reads from corresponding JSON files in the CustomData directory and returns the data in a structured JSON format.

### 3. Carousel System
Five carousel endpoints provide featured movie content for display in carousel UI components. Each carousel can contain different sets of movies for promotional or categorized display.

### 4. Filter System
The filter endpoint provides filtering options that users can apply to narrow down their movie searches by genre, year, or other criteria.

### 5. Search System
The search pages endpoint allows users to search for specific movies and view search results with relevant information.

---

## API Endpoints

### Authentication Endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Description |
|----------|--------|-------------|
| /auth/google | GET | Initiates Google OAuth login |
| /auth/google/callback | GET | Handles OAuth callback |
| /auth/login/success | GET | Returns login success status |
| /auth/login/failed | GET | Returns login failure status |
| /auth/logout | GET | Logs out user and clears session |

### Movie Data Endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Description |
|----------|--------|-------------|
| /trending | GET | Returns trending movies |
| /upcoming | GET | Returns upcoming movies |
| /recommended | GET | Returns recommended movies |
| /toprated | GET | Returns top rated movies |
| /searchpages | GET | Returns search page data |
| /filter | GET | Returns filter options |
| /carousel1 | GET | Returns carousel 1 data |
| /carousel2 | GET | Returns carousel 2 data |
| /carousel3 | GET | Returns carousel 3 data |
| /carousel4 | GET | Returns carousel 4 data |
| /carousel5 | GET | Returns carousel 5 data |

### Documentation Endpoint

| Endpoint | Method | Description |
|----------|--------|-------------|
| /api-docs | GET | Opens Swagger API documentation |
| / | GET | Returns API information |

