## Getting Started

### Starting the Server

```
bash
cd backend
npm install
npm start
```

The server will start on port 5000 by default.

### Testing the API

1. Open browser to http://localhost:5000/api-docs
2. Use the Swagger interface to test endpoints
3. Or use tools like Postman to make HTTP requests

